### 💡 Improvement 2: Dynamic Inline Filter Chips
* **The Problem:** Users must leave the search results screen to modify filters, creating a disconnected interface flow.
* **The Solution:** Introduce horizontal-scrolling inline filter chips at the very top of the search results page. Tapping a chip (e.g., "Rating 4.0+") instantly filters the list beneath it asynchronously without opening separate full-screen modals.

