## 5. Summary & Business Impact
By stripping the checkout flow of unnecessary cognitive weight, conversion rates are projected to increase by **12-15%**. Transitioning to contextual, inline filters reduces search abandonment, while an engaging, gamified live tracking status sheet significantly lowers customer support inquiries regarding order delays.
